     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "El Dorado is an open play frame with angled brown posts and Cherry Red play parts. Its main features are a wide twin wave slide, a traverse of hanging rings and a red climbing panel, with a rope net and a ring climber at the back. There is no roof or enclosed deck, so adults standing nearby can see every child. El Dorado suits children who like to hang and swing by their arms, and it fits a school ground or society play area of moderate size. It holds 20 to 25 children. The product area is 20'11\" x 17'6\" and the safe play area is 26'11\" x 23'6\". Skills listed are confidence, creative thinking and problem solving. El Dorado's galvanised pipes, moulded parts, laminates and play rope come with 3 years of cover. Send us your site size and age group."
     }
    ]
